@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
scale max 2000 width
title 03. [Admin] Authorized Counter Configuration

|Admin|
start
:Configure Counter Profile;
note right
  **Configuration includes:**
  * Location & Responsible Unit
  * Authorized Staff Assignments
  * Daily & Transaction Limits
end note

|Internal Wallet System|
if (Information Complete?) then (No)
  :Flag Missing Requirements;
  |Admin|
  :Complete Profile Details;
  |Internal Wallet System|
endif

:Validate Staff Eligibility;
note right
  Checks for active employment
  and security clearance status.
end note

if (Staff Eligible?) then (No)
  :Reject Activation;
  :State Ineligibility Reason;
  stop
endif

if (Counter Profile Exists?) then (Yes)
  :Apply Updates to Existing Counter;
else (No)
  :Register New Authorized Counter;
endif

:Grant Operational Authorization;

:Record Configuration History;
note right
  Audit log tracks Admin ID
  and changed parameters.
end note

|Admin|
:Review Status & Notify Units;
stop
@enduml